# One URL prefix per line. Lines starting with # are comments.
# Matching is StartsWith, case-insensitive, against MediaSourceInfo.Path.
#
# Changes take effect within 30 seconds — no server restart needed.
# An empty file means the patch is inert and the server behaves exactly like stock Emby.
#
# Install to <programdata>/config/strm-direct.txt
# Or override with EMBY_STRM_PREFIXES="https://a/;https://b/"
# Or point at any path with EMBY_STRM_CONFIG=/path/to/strm-direct.txt
#
# Keep prefixes narrow. Anything else Emby serves over http (Live TV channels, for example)
# must not match, or it will lose its transcoding fallback.

https://pan.example.com/
